immichset
Client photo galleries on top of Immich. AGPL-3.0-only.

The gallery design system (design/css.mjs, design/design.mjs) adapts ideas from ImmichPager,
copyright 2026 ImmichPager contributors, AGPL-3.0, used with permission:
  https://gitlab.com/wispd/ImmichPager
Adapted: the scoped, allow-listed custom CSS compiler approach, the theme and layout variables,
and the portable versioned design file. Source files credit it in their headers.

The admin panel's icons are from Lucide (https://lucide.dev), ISC licence, copyright Lucide Contributors,
the same icon set OpenCull uses. Their shapes are embedded in web/admin.html.
